flowchart TD
    Source[Approved case content] --> Normalize[Normalize and redact]
    Normalize --> Chunk[Chunk with source metadata]
    Chunk --> Embed[Generate embeddings]
    Embed --> Index[(Vector store)]
    Query[Authorized user query] --> Access[Apply access filters]
    Access --> Retrieve[Hybrid or vector retrieval]
    Index --> Retrieve
    Retrieve --> Rank[Rank and deduplicate]
    Rank --> Evidence[Evidence with source references]
    Evidence --> Reason[Reasoning and grounded response]
